OL,1,W5j 5Q7k jjs%wsj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAO'Neill hails 'momentous' ruling
OL,4,Aas court gives green light to NI's
OL,5,Alargest road project
OL,6,
OL,7,FDescribing the legal history of the
OL,8,Fproject as "long and torturous", Lady
OL,9,FChief Justice Siobhan Keegan ruled on
OL,10,Ffour main grounds including human
OL,11,Frights and climate change
OL,13,FShe said the ruling that the plans
OL,14,Fbreached human rights should be
OL,15,Freversed and also that the plans should
OL,16,Fproceed despite how it intersects with
OL,17,Fthe Climate Change Act
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/4
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
PN,41103
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1791302151
OL,1,W5j 5Q7k jjs%wsj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAO'Neill hails 'momentous' ruling
OL,4,Aas court gives green light to NI's
OL,5,Alargest road project
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn 2025, a judge ruled against the
OL,8,Fproject going ahead in its current
OL,9,Fform, upholding a legal challenge taken
OL,10,Fby a group of landowners - he said the
OL,11,Fplans breached climate change targets
OL,12,Fand criticised "an inadequacy of
OL,13,Finformation"
OL,15,FNiall McKenna, from the Enough is
OL,16,FEnough campaign which supports the road
OL,17,Fgoing ahead, said it was "not a time a
OL,18,Fcelebration" but said there was "a
OL,19,Fsense of pride"
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/4
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
